+	  found in the Xiaomi Pad 6 Pro, where it presents the folio's
+	  keyboard, media keys, mouse and touchpad.
+
+	  The bridge is not an HID-over-I2C device: it wraps standard HID
+	  input reports in a private framing. This driver unwraps them and
+	  feeds the HID core, which then binds hid-generic and, for the
+	  touchpad, hid-multitouch.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
+	  module will be called hid-nanosic.
+
 config HID_NINTENDO
 	tristate "Nintendo Joy-Con, NSO, and Pro Controller support"
 	depends on NEW_LEDS
